WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,210 --> 00:00:04,920
Brother Muchuan

2
00:00:04,970 --> 00:00:06,770
This one is meant to keep out the wind and snow, right?

3
00:00:06,770 --> 00:00:11,490
Then why don't you sit around our igloo? What's the point of standing up like this on the top of the mountain so far away? That's a good question.

4
00:00:12,370 --> 00:00:14,410
It's useful because it's far apart

5
00:00:14,770 --> 00:00:16,700
I don't understand this

6
00:00:16,700 --> 00:00:18,860
Shouldn't it be better if you advance further? I'm cold to you.

7
00:00:18,860 --> 00:00:22,540
You have to wrap me up tightly to get warm. The truth is different. Look at the wind carrying the snow.

8
00:00:22,540 --> 00:00:26,540
The wind blew from the other side of the mountain all the way. The snow was so strong that it hung in the wind and was carried along.

9
00:00:26,740 --> 00:00:27,780
But once the wind slows down

10
00:00:27,780 --> 00:00:31,660
The snow has to fall, so, so,

11
00:00:31,820 --> 00:00:33,580
I stood on the top of the mountain and exploded like this

12
00:00:34,060 --> 00:00:37,380
As soon as the wind hits it, it has to go around and slow down.

13
00:00:37,380 --> 00:00:39,380
I can't get rid of the snow it's wrapped in

14
00:00:39,660 --> 00:00:40,780
So this snow

15
00:00:40,780 --> 00:00:41,940
Right on top of this mountain

16
00:00:41,940 --> 00:00:43,020
Fell early

17
00:00:43,020 --> 00:00:44,300
Land on the top of the mountain early

18
00:00:44,300 --> 00:00:45,220
So what?

19
00:00:45,220 --> 00:00:46,420
Snow fell on the top of the mountain

20
00:00:46,420 --> 00:00:48,740
The snow drifting towards our igloo halfway up the mountain

21
00:00:48,740 --> 00:00:49,820
Just half missing

22
00:00:49,820 --> 00:00:51,780
The snow that was going to hit our side all the way

23
00:00:51,780 --> 00:00:53,260
I removed a large section here first.
